OL,3,AIranian minister says only negotiation
OL,4,Acan end conflict after Trump rejects
OL,5,AHormuz deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FOnly a "negotiated solution" can end
OL,8,Fthe conflict between the US and Iran,
OL,9,FTehran's foreign minister has said,
OL,10,Fafter President Donald Trump publicly
OL,11,Frejected a proposal to reopen the
OL,12,FStrait of Hormuz.
OL,14,FTrump told reporters at the White House
OL,15,Fthat Iran's proposal was not
OL,16,F"acceptable" and that Tehran wanted to
OL,17,Fmake a deal to open the strait to
OL,18,Fcommercial shipping within seven days
OL,19,Fbecause "they're losing so badly".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
