OL,3,AIranian minister says only negotiation
OL,4,Acan end conflict after Trump rejects
OL,5,AHormuz deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a post on Telegram, Iranian Foreign
OL,8,FMinister Abbas Araghchi acknowledged
OL,9,FTrump's rejection, but said Iran would
OL,10,Fwait for a "definitive" official US
OL,11,Fresponse.
OL,13,FHe said the president had made
OL,14,Fcontradictory statements in the past.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
